{"availability":"available","full":"OmkarPathak/TrackMyRupee","name":"TrackMyRupee","description":"TrackMyRupee - Personal finance system for India. No SMS. No Bank Login.","category":"Finance","language":"Python","stars":24,"forks":15,"created":"2025-12-27T12:14:30Z","updated":"2026-10-11T05:49:45Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://trackmyrupee.com","topics":["django","django-application","django-finance-tracker","expense-manager","expense-tracker","finance","finance-tracker","open-source","personal-finance","personal-finance-manager","privacy","self-hosted","tracking"],"demo":"https://trackmyrupee.com/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:14.464Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:14.464Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:14.464Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:14.464Z","stars":24,"forks":15}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["TrackMyRupee is a premium, privacy-focused personal finance dashboard designed for individuals who want to take full control of their financial story, without compromising their data.","Unlike traditional finance apps, TrackMyRupee does not read your SMS, does not require bank logins, and never sells your data. It is built on the principle of manual precision: you stay in the driver's seat of your wealth, and the app makes the manual part fast.","Stop being the product. Most \"free\" finance apps profit by selling your spending habits. TrackMyRupee is built differently:"],"features":["🔒 Zero Surveillance: No SMS reading. No bank scraping. Period.","⚡ Fast Manual Entry: Type \"zomato 450 yesterday upi\" and the app fills in the amount, date, category and payment method for you.","🧭 Set Up Life Events in One Form: TMR Flows turn \"I took a loan\" or \"I started a new job\" into every linked record you need.","📈 Comprehensive Net Worth: Cash, bank accounts, investments, deposits, physical assets and loans in one unified view.","🎯 Goal-S